Track 1: The Levee Breaks Its Vow
- Story & Context: When Kaelen first rigged the sub-bass to the harbor's main grid during the 2091 solstice, the sheer vibration shook a century of barnacles off the structural pilings. The air smelled of ozone and stagnant salt, a heavy, suffocating scent that clung to his lungs as the first bass-drop sent a shockwave through the water. "Hold the frequency until the stars drown," he shouted, unaware that his illicit experiment would soon force the entire district to abandon their dry-ground traditions.
